    {
      "_id": "t9SpTpnBFu3bcumr",
      "name": "Scheduled Disclosure",
      "type": "feat",
      "img": "icons/magic/time/clock-stopwatch-white-blue.webp",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The Oracle always knows more than has been said, and releases it on a schedule of their own. Advantage on Deception and Insight checks made to control when a fact becomes known. The month of Shadowfell time dilation was disclosed at the exact moment of Archie's transit preparation — not before, when it would have changed the plan.</p>",
          "chat": "Everything the Oracle says is true. The timing is the weapon."
        },
