      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The Oracle knows the ritual geometry of Raventree Manor the way a person knows a house they designed: which participants stand in geometric opposition, where the vats are, what the Separation Ritual requires. The ritual required blood. The Oracle declined to specify whose, what quantity, or for what mechanical purpose.</p>",
