      "_id": "V9AB2JL9PpRXs1Yy",
      "name": "Identity Unresolved",
      "type": "feat",
      "img": "icons/magic/control/fear-fright-white.webp",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>Possibly Orantha Cornelius. Possibly Darius. Possibly someone who has been checkpointing deaths long enough that the original identity is academically interesting and practically irrelevant. Divination that would fix the Oracle's true name or origin returns a result the caster cannot hold onto.</p>",
          "chat": "The Oracle is not a person. It is a role, wearing whoever was convenient."
        },
